4dce3e5"},"text":"一个动态而已，哪来那么大不满[emot=acfun,1655/]说两句就过去了，管天管地还能管人发动态不成。不找人商量，不相信对方才是最致命的。","time":1691193456713,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792199612","root":"792197991","user":{"id":"4747194","name":"阿九的鸽迷","avatar":"5d68145d2135f47cdda97fcf"},"text":"水姐，冷静冷静[emot=acfun,1859/]\n像我，我年轻的时候（也就几年前），做的一些事，过到现在，发现其实也没什么，不需要太过在意和担心[emot=acfun,1859/]","time":1691194215281,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"792235710","root":"792235710","user":{"id":"423418","name":"NemesisTF","avatar":"4a915eba1890208aef7ac370"},"text":"其实原本没多大的事，私下先沟通的好。","time":1691317454217,"floor":130,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792235214","root":"792235214","user":{"id":"55513717","name":"森崎唱歌好好听","avatar":"00af64e9f114128aa20987c3"},"text":"看了一下，大概知道发生什么事了，我想起以前有关系还可以的小说作者因为“引用”闹得不愉快。双方都有不妥之处，但并无恶意，所以真的是误会，两个人觉得一开始有些无法接受的，其实某种程度上有相似的地方。表面看来，两个人都犯了以她身份来说不应该犯的错，但是，我感觉恰恰是因为两个人都是主播，她们深处这个环境里，习惯了一些观念和交流方式，忽略了事情的另一面，恰恰是因为两人是朋友，关系太熟络了，忽略了沟通的重要性，才会变成现在这样，挂件是这样，动态也是这样，就是没多想而已。如果理解了这点，就知道其实并无恶意，只是误会罢了。现在有点僵住了，但有心的话真的有什么解不开的结吗，一根小小的刺，拔掉就是了！\n我要是说错了别见怪，我不太懂，有几次做梦，还梦到小学当班长，男生打架打得头破血流让我镇压，女生吵架让我调解结果被我整哭了，这实在太难了！\n水姐加油！","time":1691316246436,"floor":129,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792232418","root":"792232418","user":{"id":"285846","name":"pole","avatar":"c6ae199b87167bad6886acb8"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1859/]自己人","time":1691308600039,"floor":128,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792222225","root":"792222225","user":{"id":"311872","name":"紅染月","avatar":"6a9cf016c4db470864479d07"},"text":"水姐低估了自己的影响力[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1691258051417,"floor":126,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792221463","root":"792221463","user":{"id":"14172763","name":"松山湖底未被打捞的麒麟九千艾斯","avatar":"b9725f35e61e992b01329577"},"text":"我（抄）参考了，没给你说。你发现了有情绪也不能挂我阿，咱好歹也算是熟人吧？你看看我的贡献榜！是你过激了阿，你的错。你道歉我不完全接受。就这样吧[emot=acfun,1687/]","time":1691254547012,"floor":125,"likes":6,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":4,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"792230277","root":"792221463","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]指出问题的方式（公开发动态质疑）不合适，为此道歉是应该的。\n但质疑的事情本身，直接描改原模版做挂件是否合规，是否涉及侵权，如果有该怎么修正，这本质的是非曲直却没掰扯清楚，我是没觉得这事情是得到了解决的。但这事更适宜两人私底下自己沟通好，否则嫌隙和矛盾始终是存在的。[/color]","time":1691301584103,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792233055","root":"792221463","user":{"id":"40240577","name":"方唐景","avatar":"68071510722fe3834a4027ae"},"text":"还是了解了解再来评论吧","time":1691310890547,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792241465","root":"792221463","user":{"id":"60975013","name":"Paryi型智能击剑助手","avatar":"32e79b480a77307dca2d93d1"},"text":"节奏带得飞起啊[emot=acfun,1657/]","time":1691331238902,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"792220643","root":"792220643","user":{"id":"43645025","name":"小火龙吹泡泡","avatar":"f001cc39384f880102229dbc"},"text":"我个人觉得是冲动了。首先这个事跟当事人或者猴子交流一下为好。其二描改这个词也不妥，如国画里的上山虎、钟馗像（立绘），甚至是一些风景画（迎客松）等那都可以说是描改。抠得太细也不好。个人见解。","time":1691251907371,"floor":124,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792220353","root":"792220353","user":{"id":"441815","name":"陨落の星辰","avatar":"8a7a8580f6ca78d1fd13e284"},"text":"不知道发生了啥，就想说，都为对方想想，对方是有什么不良目的吗？如果没有，那什么不能谈？误会解开就好了啊[emot=acfun,1658/]","time":1691251157475,"floor":123,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792216947","root":"792216947","user":{"id":"66963284","name":"胡度春秋","avatar":"3131d2277177078ded90f79f"},"text":"一言不合发动态太欠考虑了，我在工作中也时不时给同事擦屁股，一般情况下我会提醒他三次，三次都没用，我才会给上司说。你不尊重我，我也就不会尊重你。","time":1691243037462,"floor":122,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792213059","root":"792213059","user":{"id":"756660","name":"阿婵AcFun唯一指定老公卖肥皂","avatar":"77e615633a9a9fe8e2059af7"},"text":"大伙现实中这么闲嘛，咋这么多时间冲浪呀[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1691233303332,"floor":121,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792212743","root":"792212743","user":{"id":"13217156","name":"蓝指导","avatar":"92c3baf69981a0779d19a2c2"},"text":"蓝字在哪[emot=acfun,1664/]","time":1691232424259,"floor":120,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792212637","root":"792212637","user":{"id":"1277005","name":"yourpenci","avatar":"be7342367f7d8a6f08e4fa3f"},"text":"水姐~~~~别太爱了","time":1691232127724,"floor":119,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792210579","root":"792210579","user":{"id":"953161","name":"石沉溪洞。","avatar":"e140188654ef3f148a352e63"},"text":"我确实是没想到的。[emot=acfun,1864/]","time":1691226503476,"floor":118,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792209782","root":"792209782","user":{"id":"207656","name":"法提娜","avatar":"c75e91493d89856c5d899ea4"},"text":"她们是现在acfun直播区最后的仅剩的几个排面主播了，希望大家少带节奏多珍惜吧[emot=acfun,2268/]","time":1691224111178,"floor":117,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792209249","root":"792209249","user":{"id":"39834327","name":"琳凛绫","avatar":"c9d6ac6ea5cbf9240f12465c"},"text":"这几天遗迹2和博德之门太好玩了。看了一会动态想了想。\n这件事在我的视野里起因，对于是不是描改，大家有很多不一样的看法。经过，对于要不要发动态还是私下说根据上面的判断大家倾向于不同的选择。最后就吵起来了。\n我想起来一个发生在身边的事情，在大家开学习会之后有对于一些手术常见术式的分析，因为是私下讨论所以大家都在聊这东西是多么的无用。隔了几天，工作群主任发言不要对患者讨论现在正在使用的术式。第一这个术式本身有没有问题，从技术角度肯定有，但现实却在使用。第二私下讨论可以，那么能不能和患者说呢，作为主任肯定不能，对于患者可以。","time":1691222610726,"floor":116,"likes":5,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792208660","root":"792208660","user":{"id":"1660411","name":"奈何胸前不长肉","avatar":"b56a43cabbf106554f212d5f"},"text":"水姐有空多歌回，有空多峡谷，有空顿打铁甚至玩新游戏，年轻的时光总是很短暂，好好珍惜啊[emot=acfun,2442/]","time":1691220806979,"floor":115,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792207867","root":"792207867","user":{"id":"688687","name":"黃湶","avatar":"881f34c5668f8fd80334b406"},"text":"有时候人会因为一句话伤害到身边的人，而你其实并不想变成这样。发展到现在再争个谁对谁错其实毫无意义，重要的是彼此，有时候对方真正想听的不是道歉，而是你的一句“我真的很在乎我们之间的感情”。当然这不一定对，我也只是经历过相似的事情。","time":1691218373119,"floor":114,"likes":5,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"00af64e9f114128aa20987c3":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/55513717_4c4a1f7fe455440b8d5a14bd81f1c5c0.jpg","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/kc450zvGig-qAbMR3-i2Ifyy-NnuMJr-36baIv.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/55513717_4c4a1f7fe455440b8d5a14bd81f1c5c0.jpg"]},"2324101853b6379b0245c92a":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/content/2020_5_1/1.5882728774978704E9.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/aBV4B2QKFU-qaA3Yz-jA